@startuml
title KTOB — Initial Deployment Model
node "Reader device" as Client {
 artifact "Web browser" as Browser
}
cloud "Vercel Hobby" as Vercel {
 artifact "Angular static web distribution" as Frontend
}
cloud "Render Free" as Render {
 node "Docker-based Spring Boot runtime" as Runtime {
  artifact "KTOB Java service application" as Jar
 }
}
cloud "Supabase" as Supa {
 database "PostgreSQL" as DB
 component "Supabase Auth" as Auth
}
cloud "External APIs" as Providers {
 component "Open Library" as Open
 component "AI provider (provisional)" as AI
 component "Seller data source (TBD)" as Seller
}
Browser --> Frontend : HTTPS load UI
Browser --> Jar : HTTPS REST
Browser --> Auth : authentication
Jar --> Auth : verify identity
Jar --> DB : TLS PostgreSQL / session pooler as needed
Jar --> Open : HTTPS metadata API
Jar --> AI : HTTPS AI API / consent
Jar ..> Seller : HTTPS lookup only if validated
note right of Render
One Java service instance initially.
May sleep after inactivity.
Multiple free containers not assumed.
end note
note bottom of Providers
Live seller verification remains unselected.
No fabricated offers when source unavailable.
end note
@enduml
